      "content": "everything is just so quiet now. i keep walking into the kitchen thinking i'll see him there or hear his nails on the floor but there's nothing. just this heavy silence. it feels kinda stupid to be this broken over a dog but i just dont see the point in doing any of this anymore. the house is too empty and it feels like everything is just... pointless.",
