      "content": "it's not just the silence though. it's like, everything feels so hollow. why do we even bother doing all this? the work, the routines, the chores... just to end up alone in an empty house eventually. it feels like a loop that doesn't actually lead anywhere. it's like we're just pretending everything matters when it really doesn't.",
